    "\n",
    "Used characteristic equation:\n",
    "\n",
    "$det(A−λI)=0$\n",
    "\n",
    "Correct polynomial:\n",
    "\n",
    "$λ^2−(a+d)λ+(ad−bc)=0$\n",
    "\n",
    "Found eigenvectors by solving:\n",
    "\n",
    "$(A−λI)v=0$\n",
    "\n",
    "✅ This is mathematically PERFECT\n",
    "This is exactly how it’s taught in math courses.\n",
    "\n",
    "⚠️ Limitations\n",
    "\n",
    "Works only for 2×2 matrices\n",
    "\n",
    "Not scalable\n",
    "\n",
    "Relies on np.roots\n",
    "\n",
    "Hard to generalize to PCA with many features\n",
    "\n",
    "📌 Verdict\n",
    "✔ Excellent for math exams / viva explanation\n",
    "❌ Not practical for ML-scale problems\n",
